{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:33:00", "text": "Hey @eid_e42b000f, for the auto-tuning process, we should consider optimizing the algorithms for low-power systems. Maybe we can add a section in the document about optimizing resource management and providing clearer system requirements. This could help users better assess compatibility. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260626-1-1c725"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-1-1c725"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:36:00", "text": "I agree with Ian. Also, for the documentation issue, we should include a detailed user guide and tutorials in the vision document. This will help users understand the parameter adjustment process better. We can also simplify the process itself if possible. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260626-2-1fa67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-2-1fa67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T15:41:00", "text": "On the integration front, we need to expand our API support and ensure compatibility with more data sources. This should be reflected in the 'Integration' section of the document. We might also want to explore partnerships with third-party providers to enhance data diversity. 🔗", "utterranceID": "20260626-3-d1641"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260626-3-d1641"}
