{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-03-12T14:02:00", "text": "@eid_8efef28a renamed the channel to planning-ContentForce-PM.", "utterranceID": "20260312-31-1ef56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260312-31-1ef56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:34:00", "text": "Hi team, I've shared the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/contentforce_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document> for ContentForce. Let's discuss and refine it to ensure it meets our goals. Looking forward to your feedback! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260313-0-4a20c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-0-4a20c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4350bf70", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:37:00", "text": "@eid_8efef28a Bob, thanks for sharing! I noticed that in the 'Technical Requirements' section, we mention 'robust architecture' but don't specify the tech stack. It might be helpful to outline the specific technologies we'll use for AI and data processing to give more clarity.", "utterranceID": "20260313-1-348fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-1-348fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_40589c87", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:41:00", "text": "Great point, Emma! Also, in the 'Compliance and Security' section, could we add more details about the specific security measures? For instance, mentioning encryption standards or authentication methods would strengthen our commitment to data privacy.", "utterranceID": "20260313-2-339cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-2-339cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c3f3eff2", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:46:00", "text": "From a UX perspective, the 'User Experience' section is solid, but I think we should emphasize user testing. Adding a line about iterative testing with sales teams could highlight our focus on usability and continuous improvement.", "utterranceID": "20260313-3-881bd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-3-881bd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:50:00", "text": "I agree with Ian Miller. User testing is crucial. Additionally, in the 'Scalability and Partnerships' section, it might be beneficial to specify potential CRM partners we're targeting. This could provide more strategic direction.", "utterranceID": "20260313-4-4c415"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-4-4c415"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:52:00", "text": "Hey team, just a thought on the 'Analytics and Reporting' section. Could we include examples of the types of insights sales teams can expect? This might help in visualizing the value proposition better.", "utterranceID": "20260313-5-318df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-5-318df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T00:55:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, everyone! @eid_4350bf70 Emma, I'll add specifics about the tech stack. @eid_40589c87 Alice, I'll include details on encryption and authentication. @eid_c3f3eff2 Ian, I'll mention iterative user testing. @eid_99835861 Ian, I'll list potential CRM partners. @eid_88e74382 Charlie, I'll add examples of insights. Let's aim to incorporate these changes by the end of the week. Any other thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260313-6-9e7ff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-6-9e7ff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T01:00:00", "text": "One last thing, Bob. In the 'Market Opportunity' section, could we add some data or statistics to back up the growth claims? It would make our case more compelling.", "utterranceID": "20260313-7-90438"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-7-90438"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ContentForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-6f4188"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-03-14T01:05:00", "text": "Great suggestion, Ian Brown. I'll look into adding some market data to support our claims. Thanks, everyone, for the valuable input! I'll update the document and share the revised version soon. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260313-8-263d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260313-8-263d1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:26:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of extAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_cb99086d.", "utterranceID": "20260828-0-1a1a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-0-1a1a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:28:00", "text": "Thanks for the heads-up, Ian. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260828-1-6800f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-1-6800f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:29:00", "text": "The AI is misinterpreting user behavior, which leads to inaccurate contextual insights.", "utterranceID": "20260828-2-edc32"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-2-edc32"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:33:00", "text": "Could it be due to inadequate training data? Maybe the models aren't exposed to enough diverse user behaviors.", "utterranceID": "20260828-3-e6820"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-3-e6820"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:34:00", "text": "@eid_798684b4 That's a good point, David. We should check the datasets used for training.", "utterranceID": "20260828-4-cd5dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-4-cd5dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:39:00", "text": "Also, there might be limitations in the AI's natural language processing capabilities. We should review the NLP components.", "utterranceID": "20260828-5-eea36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-5-eea36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:40:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. Another angle could be the feedback loop. Is it robust enough for continuous learning and improvement?", "utterranceID": "20260828-6-fd86f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-6-fd86f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:42:00", "text": "The previous team might not have set up a comprehensive feedback mechanism. We should look into that.", "utterranceID": "20260828-7-5d921"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-7-5d921"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:47:00", "text": "Let's make sure these issues are documented in our planning documents for the next release of extAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260828-8-bd276"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-8-bd276"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:51:00", "text": "Good idea, Julia. We need to ensure these are prioritized in our next development cycle.", "utterranceID": "20260828-9-2899d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-9-2899d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:06:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for extAIX is that the user interface can be overwhelming for new users. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0013.", "utterranceID": "20260829-0-72190"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-0-72190"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:10:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Ian. Since the product was developed by a different team, we should start by understanding the design choices they made.", "utterranceID": "20260829-1-f5759"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-1-f5759"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:14:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice. It seems like the complex layout with too many features presented at once could be a major factor.", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-48997"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-48997"}
