{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T09:51:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Delayed Data Refresh in Real-Time Dashboards' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/48.", "utterranceID": "20261118-0-c65a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-0-c65a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T09:53:00", "text": "The root cause was a bottleneck in the data synchronization process between the API flow optimizer and the visualization module. It wasn't optimized for real-time data streams, which led to the delays.", "utterranceID": "20261118-1-46d0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-1-46d0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T09:58:00", "text": "To fix this, I optimized the data synchronization by implementing a more efficient queuing mechanism that prioritizes real-time data updates. This should ensure that the dashboards refresh promptly.", "utterranceID": "20261118-2-90049"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-2-90049"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T10:02:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for tackling this so quickly. I'll test it out and make sure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261118-3-881cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-3-881cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T10:05:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d0d918f1! This was a critical issue for our users. Let me know if you need any help with further testing or monitoring.", "utterranceID": "20261118-4-8ce3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-4-8ce3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T10:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice and Ian! Your support is appreciated. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261118-5-782a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261118-5-782a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T23:43:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Loss During High-Volume Transactions' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/49.", "utterranceID": "20261121-0-d39ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-0-d39ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T23:45:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as the database's transaction handling mechanism, which was failing to manage high concurrency levels, leading to dropped transactions.", "utterranceID": "20261121-1-c5885"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-1-c5885"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T23:49:00", "text": "To fix this, we implemented a more robust transaction management strategy by optimizing the locking mechanism and increasing the transaction buffer size. This ensures that transactions are queued and processed efficiently even under high load.", "utterranceID": "20261121-2-5a652"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-2-5a652"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T23:53:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. This should really help with the data integrity issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261121-3-f3fa3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-3-f3fa3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T23:58:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d098d618! I'll run some tests on our end to ensure everything is stable now.", "utterranceID": "20261121-4-7c859"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-4-7c859"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T00:00:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261121-5-6e5c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-5-6e5c3"}
