{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T19:24:00", "text": "@eid_84600d40, @eid_f86a00ce joined planning-castAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260327-27-8216a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-27-8216a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12f75faa", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T23:10:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for castAIX is limited integration options with third-party data sources. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0099.", "utterranceID": "20260325-0-d615e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-0-d615e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T23:11:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the current integration capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260325-1-06656"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-1-06656"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T23:14:00", "text": "Good point, George. I suspect the lack of API support for diverse data sources could be a technical cause. We should check if there are any existing APIs that we can extend.", "utterranceID": "20260325-2-5f2f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-2-5f2f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84600d40", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T23:16:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_bd791efc. Also, the architecture might be inflexible, making it hard to add new integrations. We should review the system design to see if that's the case.", "utterranceID": "20260325-3-b9b41"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-3-b9b41"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f86a00ce", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T23:17:00", "text": "Ian, that's a valid concern. We should also consider operational factors, like whether we have limited partnerships with third-party data providers.", "utterranceID": "20260325-4-fd9a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-4-fd9a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12f75faa", "timestamp": "2026-03-27T23:18:00", "text": "Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure we document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of castAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260325-5-8ab9e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-5-8ab9e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect time series aggregation has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-3954a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-3954a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:22:00", "text": "The root cause was a misconfiguration in the aggregation logic. We were using an incorrect time interval, which distorted the input data for our forecasting model.", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-b7a67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-b7a67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:24:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the configuration to ensure the correct time intervals are used for aggregation. This involved modifying the logic to dynamically adjust based on the dataset's frequency.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-0803a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-0803a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_1bf91687! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out with the latest data.", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-6ab4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-6ab4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This should improve our trend predictions significantly. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-b9bfb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-b9bfb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:33:00", "text": "Awesome job, Julia! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-8ec3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-8ec3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:37:00", "text": "Thanks, George, Hannah, and Alice! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. Happy to help further if needed.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-762ae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-762ae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:15:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261217-0-6cc0b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-0-6cc0b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:19:00", "text": "First up, we have a security vulnerability in the User Authentication module. It allows unauthorized access through a brute force attack on the login endpoint. This is critical as it puts user accounts at risk, potentially exposing sensitive forecast data. Impacted customer: CUST-0026. @eid_1bf91687, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261217-1-02cdc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-1-02cdc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:22:00", "text": "Got it, I'll prioritize this security issue and start working on it immediately. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261217-2-4cc1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-2-4cc1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:26:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_1bf91687! Next, we have an issue with the API's rate limiting feedback. It's giving incorrect feedback, sometimes indicating a request was successful when it was actually throttled. This could lead to data handling errors for developers integrating with our API. Impacted customer: CUST-0071. @eid_1bf91687, this is also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261217-3-b6bef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-3-b6bef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:27:00", "text": "Understood, I'll look into the API rate limiting feedback issue as well. I'll make sure to get this sorted out. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261217-4-eb58c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-4-eb58c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:29:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks again! Lastly, there's an issue with the API endpoint returning incorrect HTTP status codes, like 200 OK for failed requests. This could cause developers to misinterpret request outcomes. Impacted customer: CUST-0064. @eid_8a3b36d4, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261217-5-e2d33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-5-e2d33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:31:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the API status code issue and get it fixed. Thanks for assigning it to me. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261217-6-5aaac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-6-5aaac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:35:00", "text": "Great, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let's keep our customers happy! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261217-7-c5f39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-7-c5f39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:40:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_86044ae5. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261217-8-eb1ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-8-eb1ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:42:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_86044ae5! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261217-9-981cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-9-981cf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:31:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the user interface complexity, performance with large datasets, integration limitations, prediction inaccuracies, and lack of customization. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260418-0-145e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-0-145e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f9e25d18", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:33:00", "text": "@eid_86044ae5 George, I think we should start by simplifying the User Interface section. We need to add a subsection on user onboarding and guidance. Maybe include a step-by-step tutorial or a guided tour feature for new users? This could help with the overwhelming interface issue.", "utterranceID": "20260418-1-a7542"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-1-a7542"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_69067a7c", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:34:00", "text": "Agreed, @Bob Williams. We could also consider adding more intuitive navigation elements, like a search bar or categorized menus, to make it easier for users to find what they need quickly. 🧭", "utterranceID": "20260418-2-d7a6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-2-d7a6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3b36c220", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:39:00", "text": "On the performance issue, I suggest we look into optimizing our data processing algorithms. We might need to revise the System Architecture section to include more efficient memory management strategies and possibly explore parallel processing techniques. Thoughts, @eid_f9e25d18?", "utterranceID": "20260418-3-e298e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-3-e298e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f9e25d18", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:44:00", "text": "Yes, @David Smith, that's a good point. We should also consider adding a section on resource allocation optimization. This could help us handle large datasets more efficiently. Let's make sure to document any changes in the architecture to reflect this.", "utterranceID": "20260418-4-25aa7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-4-25aa7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_104b8b57", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:46:50", "text": "@here Explore the powerful 'Prophet' library by Facebook, designed for producing high-quality forecasts. It's a great tool for anyone working with time series data! https://github.com/facebook/prophet", "utterranceID": "20260419-141-bcf2f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-141-bcf2f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_89afe48f", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:48:00", "text": "For integration, we need to expand the Integration Capabilities section. Adding support for more diverse APIs and making the architecture more flexible for new integrations could solve the current limitations. Maybe we can also explore partnerships with more third-party data providers?", "utterranceID": "20260418-5-072e4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-5-072e4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b5009faa", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:49:00", "text": "Regarding prediction inaccuracies, we should enhance our forecasting algorithms to better handle volatile data. Perhaps we could integrate more advanced machine learning models and improve our data preprocessing techniques. This might require a new subsection under System Architecture.", "utterranceID": "20260418-6-6a9a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-6-6a9a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f13e9bc", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:54:00", "text": "On customization, we need to make our model architecture more flexible. Allowing users to modify model parameters and configurations could be a game-changer. Let's add a section on customizable forecast models in the document.", "utterranceID": "20260418-7-7d330"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-7-7d330"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T21:59:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize, we'll add sections on user onboarding, optimize data processing and resource allocation, expand integration capabilities, enhance forecasting algorithms, and introduce customizable models. I'll draft these changes and share them for review. Next steps: I'll assign tasks for each section update. Thanks for the input! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260418-8-58281"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-8-58281"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T11:00:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_castaix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260419-0-b794b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260419-0-b794b"}

