{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:11:00", "text": "That's awesome! What did they say, Ian?", "utterranceID": "20260327-1-bbb8d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-1-bbb8d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:12:00", "text": "Customer CUST-0063 mentioned that the AI-powered lead scoring is really helping them prioritize high-quality leads and improve conversion rates.", "utterranceID": "20260327-2-6a5e4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-2-6a5e4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:17:00", "text": "Nice! That's a big win for the sales teams using AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260327-3-b0858"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-3-b0858"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:21:00", "text": "Absolutely. And CUST-0109 reported that the detailed analytics and insights are helping them make informed decisions about lead engagement strategies.", "utterranceID": "20260327-4-3f9c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-4-3f9c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:25:00", "text": "That's really valuable feedback. It shows how AIX is making a difference in their decision-making process.", "utterranceID": "20260327-5-60abf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-5-60abf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:29:00", "text": "And CUST-0058 highlighted that AIX's ability to continuously learn from past data is enhancing its predictive accuracy over time.", "utterranceID": "20260327-6-e2b6f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-6-e2b6f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:34:00", "text": "It's great to hear that the system is evolving and improving with use. Kudos to the previous team for setting such a strong foundation.", "utterranceID": "20260327-7-11a7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-7-11a7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:36:00", "text": "Definitely. We should build on these strengths and continue to enhance the product.", "utterranceID": "20260327-8-407a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-8-407a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-28T21:37:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's keep this momentum going and ensure we maintain this level of satisfaction.", "utterranceID": "20260327-9-8f9dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-9-8f9dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:24:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of AIX. The QA specialist, eid_4de5cd7f, reported that the AI model occasionally misclassifies leads, which could lead to missed opportunities or wasted resources.", "utterranceID": "20260327-0-bc38c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-0-bc38c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. Since the product was developed and QA tested by a different team, we should start by understanding their approach. Could it be due to inadequate training data or biased datasets?", "utterranceID": "20260327-1-edbc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-1-edbc2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:31:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. If the training data wasn't diverse enough, it might not generalize well. We should check the dataset's composition.", "utterranceID": "20260327-2-32c03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-2-32c03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:36:00", "text": "Agreed. Also, let's consider overfitting or underfitting. If the model is too complex or too simple, it might not perform well on unseen data.", "utterranceID": "20260327-3-553a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-3-553a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:41:00", "text": "@eid_4f30e22e, that's a valid concern. We should review the model's architecture and training process to ensure it's balanced.", "utterranceID": "20260327-4-64bec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-4-64bec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:43:04", "text": "@here Explore the Scikit-learn library, a powerful tool for building predictive models for lead scoring. Perfect for understanding the tech behind AIX. https://scikit-learn.org/stable/", "utterranceID": "20260330-28-63ec4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-28-63ec4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:44:00", "text": "Another angle is operational. Maybe the model hasn't been updated or retrained regularly to adapt to new data patterns. We should check the update logs.", "utterranceID": "20260327-5-9b980"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-5-9b980"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:47:00", "text": "Yes, keeping the model updated is crucial. Let's make sure there's a process in place for regular updates and retraining.", "utterranceID": "20260327-6-039be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-6-039be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:51:00", "text": "We should document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of AIX. It'll help us track and address them systematically.", "utterranceID": "20260327-7-8ad43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-7-8ad43"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:56:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. I'll make sure these points are included in the planning documents. Thanks for the input, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260327-8-871bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-8-871bb"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T05:04:00", "text": "@eid_55f01e31, @eid_7b85a749, @eid_88e74382, @eid_b814ccfb joined planning-AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260330-32-ddc9d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-32-ddc9d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:54:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of AIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_ddbe5577.", "utterranceID": "20260418-0-f333a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-0-f333a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:58:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Charlie Davis. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260418-1-98119"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-1-98119"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:59:00", "text": "The main issue is that the user interface isn't intuitive, making it hard for new users to navigate and use all features effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260418-2-0153e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-2-0153e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:03:00", "text": "Sounds like a UX design problem. Maybe the design didn't consider user feedback enough?", "utterranceID": "20260418-3-06fe0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-3-06fe0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:08:00", "text": "Good point, Ian Jones. It could also be that the design has a steep learning curve. We might need to simplify it.", "utterranceID": "20260418-4-088f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-4-088f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b85a749", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:11:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. Another angle could be the lack of proper user training or onboarding resources.", "utterranceID": "20260418-5-115ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-5-115ab"}
