{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b48f959b", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T11:50:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a summary of the changes: \n1. Add regular model retraining and diverse datasets to 'Future Enhancements'. \n2. Include user feedback loops and onboarding resources in 'Key Features'. \n3. Mention modular architecture for CRM integration in 'System Architecture'. \n4. Add performance monitoring strategies in 'Scalability and Industry Suitability'. \n5. Include system monitoring and alerting in 'Security and Compliance'. \nI'll update the document accordingly and share the revised version for final review. Thanks for the collaboration! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260416-8-69270"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-8-69270"}
