{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:31:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. If the training data wasn't diverse enough, it might not generalize well. We should check the dataset's composition.", "utterranceID": "20260327-2-32c03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-2-32c03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:36:00", "text": "Agreed. Also, let's consider overfitting or underfitting. If the model is too complex or too simple, it might not perform well on unseen data.", "utterranceID": "20260327-3-553a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-3-553a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:41:00", "text": "@eid_4f30e22e, that's a valid concern. We should review the model's architecture and training process to ensure it's balanced.", "utterranceID": "20260327-4-64bec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-4-64bec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:43:04", "text": "@here Explore the Scikit-learn library, a powerful tool for building predictive models for lead scoring. Perfect for understanding the tech behind AIX. https://scikit-learn.org/stable/", "utterranceID": "20260330-28-63ec4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-28-63ec4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:44:00", "text": "Another angle is operational. Maybe the model hasn't been updated or retrained regularly to adapt to new data patterns. We should check the update logs.", "utterranceID": "20260327-5-9b980"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-5-9b980"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:47:00", "text": "Yes, keeping the model updated is crucial. Let's make sure there's a process in place for regular updates and retraining.", "utterranceID": "20260327-6-039be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-6-039be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:51:00", "text": "We should document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of AIX. It'll help us track and address them systematically.", "utterranceID": "20260327-7-8ad43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-7-8ad43"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:56:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. I'll make sure these points are included in the planning documents. Thanks for the input, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260327-8-871bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-8-871bb"}

