{"title": "Revert PR# 12: Automated Retraining Pipeline", "summary": "This revert is necessary due to a change in product direction. The focus has shifted away from frequent model updates to a more stable version approach, making the automated retraining pipeline unnecessary. The pipeline was standalone and did not affect other components directly.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/AIX/pull/14", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "14", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_90359c89"}, "created_at": "2026-06-17T19:29:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_a43a4389"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-06-18T20:43:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_207da0e7"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-06-18T20:47:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_9f4e2c6f"}, "comment": "Approved", "submitted_at": "2026-06-18T20:48:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_AIX_pull_14"}
{"title": "Revert PR# 13: Fix authentication and data handling issues", "summary": "This reverts PR# 13 due to critical bugs introduced in the application, including authentication failures and incorrect data retrieval from HubSpot. Additionally, some endpoints are not configured correctly, leading to data handling errors. Reverting this PR will allow us to address these issues without affecting the current application functionality.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/AIX/pull/15", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "15", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_99835861"}, "created_at": "2026-06-17T19:29:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_a43a4389"}, "comment": "Approved", "submitted_at": "2026-06-19T13:47:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_207da0e7"}, "comment": "Looks good", "submitted_at": "2026-06-19T13:52:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_AIX_pull_15"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:17:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI misclassification, UI challenges, CRM integration limitations, performance issues, and reliability concerns. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260412-0-ba65c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-0-ba65c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:20:00", "text": "@eid_8efef28a, for the AI misclassification issue, I suggest we add a section on 'Data Quality and Model Training' under System Architecture. We should emphasize the need for diverse and regularly updated datasets to improve model accuracy. Thoughts, @Ian Brown?", "utterranceID": "20260412-1-4a73a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-1-4a73a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:25:00", "text": "Great point, Ian! 👍 We should also include a 'User Feedback Loop' in the Future Enhancements section to ensure continuous improvement based on real-world usage. This could help with both AI accuracy and UI intuitiveness.", "utterranceID": "20260412-2-03476"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-2-03476"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f6ae6dd8", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:29:00", "text": "I agree with @Ian Brown. Adding a feedback loop is crucial. Additionally, we should expand the 'Future Enhancements' to include 'Enhanced CRM Integration' with a focus on modular architecture to support more systems. This will address the integration limitations.", "utterranceID": "20260412-3-29308"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-3-29308"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:34:00", "text": "Regarding performance issues, we might need to update the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section to include 'Performance Monitoring and Optimization Strategies'. This could involve regular load testing and resource allocation adjustments.", "utterranceID": "20260412-4-418ba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-4-418ba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:38:00", "text": "Thanks for the input, everyone! To summarize: \n1. Add 'Data Quality and Model Training' under System Architecture.\n2. Introduce a 'User Feedback Loop' in Future Enhancements.\n3. Expand 'Enhanced CRM Integration' with modular architecture.\n4. Include 'Performance Monitoring and Optimization Strategies'.\n\nLet's make these changes and reconvene to finalize. Any objections or additional thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260412-5-63e58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-5-63e58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:43:00", "text": "No objections here! Let's proceed with these updates. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260412-6-8853a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-6-8853a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:44:00", "text": "All good from my side too. Looking forward to seeing the revised document! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260412-7-870ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-7-870ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f6ae6dd8", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T22:49:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid plan, @Bob Garcia. Let's get these changes implemented and ensure AIX is on the right track. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260412-8-7df04"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260412-8-7df04"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T07:48:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_aix_product_vision_document|Product Vision Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260414-0-f4e78"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-0-f4e78"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:52:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, especially around AI misclassification, UI intuitiveness, CRM integration, performance, and reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260414-0-620b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-0-620b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:53:00", "text": "Hey @eid_8efef28a, for the AI misclassification issue, I think we should add a section on enhancing our training data strategy. We need more diverse datasets and regular retraining schedules to keep the model sharp. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260414-1-c0b29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-1-c0b29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:58:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. Also, we should incorporate user feedback loops in the 'Future Enhancements' section to improve the UI. This will help address the steep learning curve new users face. Maybe a dedicated UX research phase? @eid_8efef28a", "utterranceID": "20260414-2-1bff4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-2-1bff4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T16:00:00", "text": "For the CRM integration issue, we should consider expanding the 'System Architecture' section to include a more modular approach. This will help us support a wider range of CRM systems more easily. @eid_8efef28a", "utterranceID": "20260414-3-372a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-3-372a2"}
