{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:14:00", "text": "Hey Charlie, for the AI-generated pitches, we should expand the 'Core AI Engine' section to include plans for enhancing NLP capabilities. This could involve increasing training data diversity and improving algorithms to capture subtle nuances. What do you think, @eid_8df92d08?", "utterranceID": "20260713-1-bdfdc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-1-bdfdc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:17:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. We should also mention the need for industry-specific datasets to improve context relevance. This will help tailor pitches more effectively. Maybe we can add a subsection under 'Future Enhancements' for this?", "utterranceID": "20260713-2-faaaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-2-faaaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_965867b8", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T17:21:00", "text": "For the performance slowdowns, we should update the 'System Architecture' section to include strategies for load balancing and resource scaling during peak times. This will address the server capacity issues. @eid_ee9ca887, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260713-3-f36be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260713-3-f36be"}
