{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T15:59:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect feature extraction titled 'Feature Extraction Failure' has been resolved. You can check out the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/58.", "utterranceID": "20270302-0-ad4c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-0-ad4c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:03:00", "text": "The root cause was an error in the feature extraction module. It was overlooking critical customer attributes like recent purchase history and engagement metrics.", "utterranceID": "20270302-1-a7ac9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-1-a7ac9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:04:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the module to correctly parse and include these attributes by adjusting the data parsing logic and adding additional checks for null values. This ensures all relevant customer data is captured for personalized pitches.", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-9e386"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-9e386"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:06:00", "text": "Great work, Bob! Thanks for the quick turnaround on this. @eid_38700e5f", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-a7871"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-a7871"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob. This should really improve the personalization of our pitches. I'll run some tests to confirm everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-84faa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-84faa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dd1ff0ca", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:13:00", "text": "Appreciate the update, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from my end to ensure this fix is solid.", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-1054a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-1054a"}
