{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:08:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 We need to address the AI misinterpretation of complex queries, integration inconsistencies, slow performance during peak times, customization difficulties, and reliability issues. Let's dive in! @eid_9b8bc088, could you start with the AI misinterpretation issue?", "utterranceID": "20261002-0-ada58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-0-ada58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9b8bc088", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:11:00", "text": "Sure thing, Julia! For the AI misinterpretation issue, I suggest we enhance the 'Intelligent Search Algorithms' section. We should specify the need for improved NLU capabilities and include a plan for expanding the training data to cover more complex query patterns. This will help refine the AI's understanding and improve search relevance. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261002-1-2cc38"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-1-2cc38"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:15:01", "text": "@here This blog post explores the integration of AI in search engines and its benefits in delivering personalized search results. https://www.searchenginejournal.com/ai-integration-in-search-engines-2023", "utterranceID": "20261004-133-4b754"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-133-4b754"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f944b0ee", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:16:00", "text": "I agree with David. Also, we should add a subsection on 'Context Awareness Algorithms' under 'Intelligent Search Algorithms'. This can help address the limitations in context awareness. @eid_4f731d34, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261002-2-a37f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-2-a37f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f731d34", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:18:00", "text": "Good point, Alice. Adding context awareness improvements will definitely help. We should also consider adding a feedback loop mechanism to continuously learn from user interactions. This could be a game-changer for improving AI accuracy over time. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261002-3-cff17"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-3-cff17"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_887367ca", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:20:00", "text": "For integration issues, we need to enhance the 'Integration' section. Let's include a standardized protocol for third-party integrations and improve error handling mechanisms. This will ensure more consistent data retrieval. @eid_efc9418c, any additional thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261002-4-120cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-4-120cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_efc9418c", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:21:00", "text": "Great suggestions, George! We should also document API compatibility requirements more clearly. This will help third-party developers align with our system more effectively. 📚", "utterranceID": "20261002-5-6cfe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-5-6cfe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b34186ad", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:24:00", "text": "Regarding the slow performance issue, we should expand the 'Scalability' section to include more robust load balancing strategies. Additionally, optimizing query processing algorithms can significantly improve performance during peak times. @eid_5a940dab, do you have any insights?", "utterranceID": "20261002-6-fd9e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-6-fd9e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5a940dab", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma. We should also consider increasing server resources during peak times as a temporary measure while we work on long-term solutions. This can be mentioned under 'Performance Monitoring'. 📈", "utterranceID": "20261002-7-9d32b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-7-9d32b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5b61c55e", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:29:00", "text": "For customization difficulties, let's enhance the 'User Interface' section. We need to provide more flexible options for search parameter configuration and improve user training materials. This will empower users to tailor the search to their needs. @eid_aa99608e, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261002-8-6e1d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-8-6e1d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:34:00", "text": "I agree, Charlie. We should also gather more user feedback to understand specific customization needs better. This can be part of our continuous improvement process. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-5e3b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-5e3b2"}
