{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eb1756e0", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T02:47:00", "text": "The sentiment analysis is misinterpreting sarcasm and humor, leading to inaccurate sentiment reports.", "utterranceID": "20260328-2-79fe3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-2-79fe3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T02:50:00", "text": "Sounds like a tricky issue. Could it be due to limitations in the NLP algorithms we're using?", "utterranceID": "20260328-3-590d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-3-590d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2589c967", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T02:52:00", "text": "@eid_802e8eff That's possible, Charlie. NLP has always struggled with sarcasm and humor.", "utterranceID": "20260328-4-33f11"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-4-33f11"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T02:53:00", "text": "Another angle could be the training data. Maybe it doesn't have enough examples of sarcasm and humor?", "utterranceID": "20260328-5-6d05a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-5-6d05a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eb1756e0", "timestamp": "2026-03-31T02:56:00", "text": "Good point, Emma. We might need to expand our dataset to include more varied examples.", "utterranceID": "20260328-6-e0963"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260328-6-e0963"}
