{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about improper session management has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/26.", "utterranceID": "20260627-0-f6767"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-0-f6767"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:31:00", "text": "The root cause was that the session management system wasn't revoking tokens upon user logout, which left sessions open to hijacking.", "utterranceID": "20260627-1-bdea0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-1-bdea0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:36:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the logout process to explicitly invalidate session tokens by adding a token revocation step. This ensures that tokens are properly invalidated and sessions are securely terminated.", "utterranceID": "20260627-2-0a6af"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-2-0a6af"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-27T22:38:00", "text": "Great work, Fiona! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. This was a critical issue.", "utterranceID": "20260627-3-2a7c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260627-3-2a7c5"}
