{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71bfb0a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T05:46:00", "text": "Hi team, I've been reviewing the recent changes from PR# 6 and noticed some potential security risks. Can we discuss whether we should consider reverting it?", "utterranceID": "20260616-0-63f3e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-0-63f3e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5636d3f5", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T05:49:00", "text": "Hey @eid_71bfb0a9, what specific security risks are you concerned about? I want to make sure we're all on the same page.", "utterranceID": "20260616-1-52bc1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-1-52bc1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71bfb0a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T05:51:00", "text": "The main issue is that the JWT implementation might not be handling token expiration and validation securely. There could be vulnerabilities that expose user data.", "utterranceID": "20260616-2-bd414"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-2-bd414"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_51f50b3a", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T05:52:00", "text": "That's concerning. @eid_9a7b2132, can you provide more details on how the token expiration and validation are handled in the PR?", "utterranceID": "20260616-3-411fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-3-411fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T05:54:00", "text": "Sure, the tokens are set to expire after 30 minutes, and we use a secret key for validation. However, I understand there might be concerns about the strength of the key and the validation process.", "utterranceID": "20260616-4-e4f49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-4-e4f49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6936f36d", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T05:59:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, @eid_9a7b2132. @eid_71071933, @eid_8605f7ee, @eid_4e8b2cdc, what are your thoughts on this? Should we revert the PR?", "utterranceID": "20260616-5-4cb51"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-5-4cb51"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1deacc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71071933", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T06:01:00", "text": "I think if there's a potential risk, we should be cautious. It's better to address these concerns before they become a bigger issue.", "utterranceID": "20260616-6-1f3fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260616-6-1f3fe"}
