{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:16:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect CORS configuration has been resolved. The fix has been merged into the main branch. You can check the details here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/51.", "utterranceID": "20270205-0-858ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-0-858ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:18:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_7687dbe6! Could you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270205-1-5b805"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-1-5b805"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:22:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was that our CORS configuration was set to allow all origins by default. This meant that any domain could access our API, which is a security risk.", "utterranceID": "20270205-2-d9e9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-2-d9e9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270205-3-ee28e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-3-ee28e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:30:00", "text": "I updated the CORS policy to validate against a list of trusted domains. Now, only requests from these domains will be allowed. This should prevent unauthorized access to customer data.", "utterranceID": "20270205-4-65b33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-4-65b33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:34:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Fiona!", "utterranceID": "20270205-5-5af56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-5-5af56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:35:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work @eid_7687dbe6. Let me know if there's anything else I can help with.", "utterranceID": "20270205-6-9a0f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-6-9a0f0"}
