{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e4a3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_932ce89c", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T15:33:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data ingestion has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/53.", "utterranceID": "20270214-0-dcb57"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-0-dcb57"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e4a3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_932ce89c", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T15:37:00", "text": "The issue was due to a bug in the ETL pipeline that caused data corruption during the transformation phase. This led to missing or incorrect customer attributes being used for pitch generation.", "utterranceID": "20270214-1-9ef2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-1-9ef2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e4a3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_932ce89c", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T15:42:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the transformation logic to ensure data integrity checks are performed before and after the transformation process. This prevents any corrupted data from being processed further.", "utterranceID": "20270214-2-73d79"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-2-73d79"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e4a3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T15:44:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_932ce89c! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. Does this mean the data for future pitches will be accurate now?", "utterranceID": "20270214-3-9e4aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270214-3-9e4aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e4a3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_932ce89c", "timestamp": "2027-02-14T15:45:00", "text": "Yes, Hannah. With the new integrity checks in place, we should see accurate and up-to-date customer data being used for all future pitch generations.", "utterranceID": "20270214-4-d2acb"}, "Reactions": [

