{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect timestamps in SentimentForce due to timezone misalignment has been resolved. 🎉 You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/48", "utterranceID": "20261219-0-37452"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-0-37452"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:30:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_13cb0e90! Can you give us a quick rundown of what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:32:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our API Integration Module wasn't converting timestamps to a consistent timezone before processing. This led to temporal data inconsistencies and inaccurate sentiment trends.", "utterranceID": "20261219-2-87113"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-2-87113"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261219-3-56141"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-3-56141"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:40:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the API Integration Module to include a timezone conversion step. Now, all incoming timestamps are converted to UTC before any processing occurs. This ensures consistency across all data points.", "utterranceID": "20261219-4-917da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-4-917da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:41:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Julia!", "utterranceID": "20261219-5-9a8fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-5-9a8fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:43:00", "text": "Agreed, great work @eid_13cb0e90! Let us know if there's anything else we need to test on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261219-6-92fcf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-6-92fcf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:48:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma and Ian! I'll keep you posted if any further testing is needed, but for now, everything looks good. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261219-7-a8981"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-7-a8981"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:17:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent sentiment scoring across channels has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/49.", "utterranceID": "20261221-0-5835d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-0-5835d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:19:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! What was causing the inconsistency?", "utterranceID": "20261221-1-0e5f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-1-0e5f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:21:00", "text": "The root cause was that our sentiment analysis engine didn't account for channel-specific language nuances or context. This led to significant variations in sentiment scores for similar messages across different channels.", "utterranceID": "20261221-2-72918"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-2-72918"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261221-3-3e131"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-3-3e131"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:26:00", "text": "To address the issue, I implemented a context-aware layer in the sentiment analysis engine. This layer now considers channel-specific language patterns and adjusts the sentiment scoring accordingly. This should ensure more consistent results across different channels.", "utterranceID": "20261221-4-123a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-4-123a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:29:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid solution, Ian. Thanks for tackling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261221-5-00928"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-5-00928"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:32:00", "text": "Yes, thanks @eid_8658e19c! I'll keep an eye on the sentiment reports to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261221-6-07f4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-6-07f4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:36:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261221-7-64aef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-7-64aef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:54:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:57:00", "text": "The root cause was an inadequate cache size and improper cache invalidation policies, which led to frequent cache misses and increased database load for sentiment data queries.", "utterranceID": "20261224-1-b7d89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-1-b7d89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:58:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the cache size and implemented a more efficient cache invalidation strategy. This should significantly reduce the number of cache misses and alleviate the database load.", "utterranceID": "20261224-2-62b27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-2-62b27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:01:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The new caching strategy should help improve our system's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:05:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_8658e19c! I'll monitor the database load over the next few days to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261224-4-0cb86"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-4-0cb86"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:06:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d96fb219. Let me know if you notice any issues. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261224-5-297b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-5-297b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:11:00", "text": "Thanks again, Ian. This should make a big difference for our users. Let's keep an eye on the metrics and see how it performs.", "utterranceID": "20261224-6-bee21"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-6-bee21"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T03:55:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Fragmentation Issues' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/44.", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-44007"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-44007"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:00:00", "text": "The root cause was frequent updates and deletions in our database tables without regular defragmentation, which led to fragmented data storage and increased I/O operations.", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-20be0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-20be0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:01:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a scheduled defragmentation process that runs during off-peak hours. This should help maintain optimal data retrieval speeds by reducing fragmentation.", "utterranceID": "20261113-2-05847"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-2-05847"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:06:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13cb0e90! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The scheduled defragmentation sounds like a solid solution.", "utterranceID": "20261113-3-22814"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-3-22814"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing. I'll monitor the retrieval speeds over the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20261113-4-26bf0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-4-26bf0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:09:00", "text": "Awesome job, Julia Davis! Let me know if you need any help with further testing or monitoring.", "utterranceID": "20261113-5-25fb6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-5-25fb6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:14:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_d96fb219, please keep me posted on the performance metrics. @eid_8658e19c, I'll reach out if we need additional testing. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261113-6-1853f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-6-1853f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:09:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing'.", "utterranceID": "20260921-0-c43da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-0-c43da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:12:00", "text": "The system was encountering errors when parsing JSON responses from Slack, which was leading to dropped messages and incomplete sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-1-c727b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-1-c727b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:15:00", "text": "After reviewing the issue, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-72c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-72c6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:16:00", "text": "Hey Bob, could you explain why it's not a bug?", "utterranceID": "20260921-3-cf27f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-3-cf27f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:20:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_92294e45. The JSON parser is actually functioning as expected. The errors were due to malformed JSON responses that were not compliant with Slack's API documentation.", "utterranceID": "20260921-4-e84f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-4-e84f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:23:00", "text": "These malformed responses are rare and typically result from network issues or third-party integrations sending unexpected data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-5-012cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-5-012cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:26:00", "text": "So, it's more of a data integrity issue rather than a bug in our system?", "utterranceID": "20260921-6-bdb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-6-bdb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:27:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. Our system is designed to handle well-formed JSON as per the API specs. Handling every possible malformed structure would be inefficient and unnecessary.", "utterranceID": "20260921-7-325fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-7-325fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Bob. Did you take any action to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:34:00", "text": "Yes, I reviewed the logs and tested with both valid and intentionally malformed JSON. The system processed valid JSON correctly and only failed on malformed data, which is expected.", "utterranceID": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:37:00", "text": "Got it. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Bob.", "utterranceID": "20260921-10-949ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-10-949ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:41:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! If any further issues arise, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20260921-11-8b26d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-11-8b26d"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sarcasm detection in our sentiment analysis engine has been resolved. You can check the details here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/40", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-bc593"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-bc593"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:32:00", "text": "That's great news, Ian! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-2822d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-2822d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:37:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was that our sentiment model lacked advanced contextual understanding and tone detection, which are crucial for identifying sarcasm.", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:42:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, @eid_31cb6db5?", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-dee68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-dee68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:44:00", "text": "Good question, Charlie. We enhanced the model by integrating a new layer that uses transformer-based architecture to better understand context and tone. This allows it to differentiate between literal and sarcastic remarks more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20261021-4-70cf9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-4-70cf9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:48:00", "text": "Impressive work, Ian! This should really improve our sentiment analysis accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20261021-5-0fb3e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-5-0fb3e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:52:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian. Thanks for the update and the hard work on this fix!", "utterranceID": "20261021-6-3e1be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-6-3e1be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:56:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20261021-7-64dfa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-7-64dfa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:55:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Slack Channel Subscription Errors' has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261025-0-75ca9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-0-75ca9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:57:00", "text": "The issue was that our system wasn't subscribing to new Slack channels automatically, which meant we were missing out on sentiment data from those channels.", "utterranceID": "20261025-1-cc882"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-1-cc882"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T12:59:00", "text": "The root cause was that our API Integration Module didn't dynamically update its channel subscription list when new channels were created or existing ones were renamed.", "utterranceID": "20261025-2-b3ce2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-2-b3ce2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:02:00", "text": "I've fixed this by implementing a listener that detects changes in the channel list and updates the subscription list accordingly. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/41", "utterranceID": "20261025-3-fe9fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-3-fe9fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:06:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for the quick turnaround on this. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20261025-4-6a6ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-4-6a6ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:10:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6cc1a0f6! This should really help us keep our sentiment data up to date. I'll make sure to test it out on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261025-5-03ddc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-5-03ddc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-25T13:11:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Ian! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261025-6-6e0aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261025-6-6e0aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sentiment scores on the dashboard, titled 'Sentiment Model Drift', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/42.", "utterranceID": "20261028-0-a22e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-0-a22e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:12:00", "text": "The root cause was that our sentiment analysis model hadn't been retrained with recent data, which led to outdated or inaccurate sentiment scores being displayed.", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-ae66c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-ae66c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:17:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the model training pipeline to automatically incorporate new data every month. This ensures the model stays current and accurate. I've also added a monitoring system to alert us if the model's performance starts to degrade.", "utterranceID": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:18:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. The monitoring system sounds like a solid addition.", "utterranceID": "20261028-3-46138"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-3-46138"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:23:00", "text": "@eid_31cb6db5 Thanks, Ian! This should definitely improve the accuracy of our sentiment scores. Let me know if you need any help with the monitoring system.", "utterranceID": "20261028-4-37214"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-4-37214"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:28:00", "text": "Thanks, David and Charlie! I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks good on my end.", "utterranceID": "20261028-5-7846b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-5-7846b"}

