{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-zeaix-5f5953"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71c0d545", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T05:35:00", "text": "I agree with Alice. Additionally, in the User Interface section, could we add more details on how customizable the summary settings will be? For example, can users set the length of summaries or choose specific channels to summarize?", "utterranceID": "20261015-3-6c76f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261015-3-6c76f"}
