{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:41:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect API Authentication Failure has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/54.", "utterranceID": "20261225-0-36305"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-0-36305"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:42:00", "text": "The issue was due to a misconfiguration in the OAuth token validation process, which was incorrectly rejecting valid tokens.", "utterranceID": "20261225-1-6a4fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-1-6a4fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:45:00", "text": "To fix this, I adjusted the validation logic to correctly parse and validate the incoming tokens. This ensures that valid tokens are now accepted as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261225-2-8ed44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-2-8ed44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:48:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. @eid_70223d0a", "utterranceID": "20261225-3-f215c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-3-f215c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:49:00", "text": "Thanks, David! This should help reduce the number of support tickets we've been getting. I'll inform the support team. @eid_70223d0a", "utterranceID": "20261225-4-190ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-4-190ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2594f98a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:53:00", "text": "Awesome! Thanks for the update, David. I'll run some tests on our end to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261225-5-25c95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-5-25c95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-26T09:56:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any further issues. @Alice Jones, @Fiona Davis, @Emma Williams", "utterranceID": "20261225-6-f0234"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261225-6-f0234"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T12:54:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261229-0-712ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-0-712ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T12:59:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Data Mapping'. The AI-powered feature is incorrectly mapping data points to visualizations, which could lead to users making decisions based on outdated data. This affects the Database & User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0040. @eid_8986ddc3, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261229-1-bff3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-1-bff3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:04:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data mapping issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261229-2-05aeb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-2-05aeb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:06:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Unauthorized Access Vulnerability' in the Security Module. This is a significant security risk as it allows unauthorized users to access certain collaborative features. Customer CUST-0096 is affected. @eid_63ea0ec4, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261229-3-2962a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-3-2962a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:11:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize the security vulnerability and ensure we patch it up ASAP. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261229-4-22d37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-4-22d37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:12:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_63ea0ec4! Lastly, there's an 'Inconsistent API Key Validation' issue affecting the API Authentication Layer. This is causing sporadic access denials for external applications, impacting customer CUST-0086. @eid_63ea0ec4, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261229-5-6c8e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-5-6c8e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:13:00", "text": "No problem, I'll handle the API key validation issue as well. I'll make sure to coordinate with the team to get this sorted out. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261229-6-73e07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-6-73e07"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:18:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, feel free to reach out. Let's keep our customers happy! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261229-7-a07ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-7-a07ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:19:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update once I have more info on the data mapping fix. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261229-8-bc5ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-8-bc5ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_63ea0ec4", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T13:22:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you all posted on the progress for both issues. Thanks for the support, team! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261229-9-e1a30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-9-e1a30"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:27:00", "text": "Hi team, I was reading about a competitor product called VizTeam Connect. It's quite interesting because it offers AI-powered suggestions for data visualization and interpretation. This could be a game-changer for teams looking to make sense of complex data quickly.", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-b8e59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-b8e59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:31:00", "text": "🤔 That sounds intriguing, Alice! How exactly do the AI-powered suggestions work? Are they customizable?", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-33794"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-33794"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:34:00", "text": "Great question, Julia! The AI analyzes the data and suggests the most effective visualization types and interpretations. Users can customize these suggestions to better fit their specific needs, which makes it flexible for different use cases.", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-87bf6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-87bf6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:37:00", "text": "Alice, what about their collaboration tools? How do they compare to what we currently offer?", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-3d73d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-3d73d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:42:00", "text": "Charlie, VizTeam Connect has built-in collaboration tools that allow team discussions and feedback directly within the platform. It seems to streamline communication by keeping everything in one place, which could enhance productivity.", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-a1bfa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-a1bfa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ec5cb5c2", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:47:00", "text": "Alice, does it support a wide range of data formats and sources? That's often a big selling point for our clients.", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-76bba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-76bba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:49:00", "text": "Yes, Alice Taylor, it supports a wide range of data formats and sources, which makes it versatile for different industries and data types. This could be a strong advantage for them.", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-7d7e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-7d7e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:54:00", "text": "Bob here. How user-friendly is the interface? Especially for non-technical users?", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-73634"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-73634"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:58:00", "text": "Bob, the interface is designed to be very user-friendly, catering specifically to non-technical users. This could lower the barrier for entry and make it appealing to a broader audience.", "utterranceID": "20260915-8-3e0d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-8-3e0d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T22:03:00", "text": "👍 Thanks for the insights, Alice! Do you see any potential weaknesses or areas where we might have an edge?", "utterranceID": "20260915-9-7ac95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-9-7ac95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T22:04:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. While VizTeam Connect is strong in many areas, our edge might be in the depth of customization and integration capabilities we offer. Also, our customer support and training programs are highly rated, which could be a differentiator.", "utterranceID": "20260915-10-663a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-10-663a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4fc423da", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T22:09:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. This gives us a lot to think about. Let's keep these points in mind as we continue to refine our product strategy. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260915-11-477c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-11-477c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ec5cb5c2", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T22:11:00", "text": "Agreed, Charlie. It's always good to know what the competition is up to. Thanks for the detailed breakdown, Alice!", "utterranceID": "20260915-12-6818c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-12-6818c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T22:16:00", "text": "Yes, thanks, Alice! Let's keep pushing forward. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260915-13-26343"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-13-26343"}
