{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f1ff493", "timestamp": "2026-06-13T20:42:00", "text": "I agree with David and Fiona. Additionally, in the Integration Requirements, we should clarify what 'seamless incorporation' means. Maybe we could outline some specific integration scenarios or use cases? This could help in understanding the scope better. @eid_1e7c8290", "utterranceID": "20260613-3-48fc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-3-48fc6"}
