{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1e7c8290", "timestamp": "2026-06-13T20:51:00", "text": "Great feedback, everyone! 😊 @eid_131494b8, I'll add specific accuracy benchmarks for AI insights. @eid_bc469a8f, I'll include performance metrics like response times. @eid_9f1ff493, I'll work on detailing integration scenarios. @eid_73a50f06, mentioning ISO 27001 is a great idea. I'll incorporate these changes and share an updated draft soon. Any other thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260613-5-228d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-5-228d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0e2e8d07", "timestamp": "2026-06-13T20:54:00", "text": "Just one more thing, Hannah. In the Recommendations section, we talk about expanding integration options. Could we list potential new tools or platforms we're considering? This might help in strategic planning. @eid_1e7c8290", "utterranceID": "20260613-6-b273b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-6-b273b"}
