{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:26:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect lead scoring due to feature drift has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/46.", "utterranceID": "20261001-0-e22f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-0-e22f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261001-1-57087"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-1-57087"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:30:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that our AI model hadn't been retrained to account for recent shifts in lead engagement patterns. This led to feature drift, causing the scoring algorithm to produce inconsistent and outdated lead scores.", "utterranceID": "20261001-2-089c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-2-089c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:33:00", "text": "Got it, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261001-3-9ae18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-3-9ae18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:35:00", "text": "@eid_99835861, I addressed the issue by updating our model retraining schedule. Now, the model will be retrained every two weeks to ensure it captures any shifts in lead behavior. Additionally, I implemented a monitoring system to alert us if feature drift is detected in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261001-4-17ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-4-17ab6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:38:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid plan, Ian. Thanks for taking care of this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261001-5-fdaf3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-5-fdaf3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:41:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks Ian. This should help us maintain more accurate lead scores moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20261001-6-6162f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-6-6162f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:46:00", "text": "No problem, glad to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261001-7-dd59f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-7-dd59f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in Lead Data Export' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/60.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-4e189"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-4e189"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:19:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Can you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-7f34a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-7f34a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:24:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that the export module lacked proper encryption protocols for securing data during file generation. This led to sensitive lead information being exposed during the export process.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-b3825"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-b3825"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-d5d00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-d5d00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:32:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented AES-256 encryption for the exported files. This ensures that all sensitive lead data is securely encrypted during the export process. Additionally, I added a verification step to ensure that the encryption is applied correctly before the files are made available for download.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-6aca5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-6aca5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:33:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix, Ian. Thanks for handling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:35:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_9f4e2c6f. Thanks for the quick turnaround. Let me know if there's anything else you need from us.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-6d1bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-6d1bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:36:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_3f4b2681 and Ian. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261201-7-5fc71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-7-5fc71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:30:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261213-0-a1ebc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-0-a1ebc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:32:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Insecure Data Transmission in Export Process'. The lead data is being transmitted over unsecured channels during export, which could lead to data breaches. This affects the Data Export Module and impacts customer CUST-0040. @eid_07cc9100, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261213-1-9c61e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-1-9c61e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:37:00", "text": "Got it! I'll prioritize this and ensure the data transmission is secured. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261213-2-8bc96"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-2-8bc96"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:40:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Progress Bar Stalls During Import'. The progress bar isn't updating in real-time during lead import, making the system seem unresponsive. This affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0003. @eid_c39dc658, can you handle this one? 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261213-3-bb089"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-3-bb089"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:44:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the UI code and see what's causing the delay. Thanks for assigning this to me! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261213-4-1a913"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-4-1a913"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:49:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an issue with a 'Modal Dialog Blocks UI Interaction'. A modal dialog is blocking users from accessing other parts of the app during lead import. This also affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0091. @eid_07cc9100, could you also take this one? 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20261213-5-0b1d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-5-0b1d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:53:00", "text": "No problem, I'll tackle this along with the data transmission issue. Let's make sure our users can multitask smoothly! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261213-6-023dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-6-023dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:54:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and productive. Feel free to reach out if you need any more details or support. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261213-7-b34fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-7-b34fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:57:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 💼", "utterranceID": "20261213-8-bce7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-8-bce7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:59:00", "text": "Absolutely, let's get to work! 🏃‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20261213-9-98f18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-9-98f18"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:31:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for AIX is slow performance during peak usage times. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0040.", "utterranceID": "20260415-0-4cb69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260415-0-4cb69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:32:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Ian Brown. Since the product was developed by a different team, we should start by checking if there's insufficient server capacity.", "utterranceID": "20260415-1-9e15a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260415-1-9e15a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:33:00", "text": "Good point, @eid_f98d7490. We should also look into whether there's inefficient resource allocation. That could be a big factor.", "utterranceID": "20260415-2-9b61f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260415-2-9b61f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:38:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian Jones. Another angle could be the lack of performance monitoring and scaling strategies. We need to ensure we're scaling properly during peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260415-3-d0789"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260415-3-d0789"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:39:00", "text": "Right, Fiona. We should also consider if there are inefficient code or database queries causing bottlenecks. That might be slowing things down.", "utterranceID": "20260415-4-4704b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260415-4-4704b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T12:40:00", "text": "Let's make sure we document these potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of AIX. We need to address these issues systematically.", "utterranceID": "20260415-5-5607e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260415-5-5607e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_890654c4", "timestamp": "2026-04-09T22:15:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260408-0-a77f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260408-0-a77f2"}
