{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_890654c4", "timestamp": "2026-04-09T22:19:00", "text": "Great point, Ian Garcia! We should definitely emphasize the need for diverse datasets and regular updates. I'll add a note about retraining the model to adapt to new data patterns. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260408-2-d29d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260408-2-d29d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-09T22:22:00", "text": "For the 'System Architecture' section, we should highlight the need for a more modular design to support multiple CRM systems. This will address the integration limitations we've seen.", "utterranceID": "20260408-3-e28f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260408-3-e28f4"}
