{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data types in lead attributes has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/55.", "utterranceID": "20261115-0-814e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-0-814e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:48:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261115-1-292d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-1-292d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:51:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_3f4b2681. The root cause was a schema mismatch between the application layer and the database. Some fields were being cast to incorrect types during data insertion, which led to errors in our lead scoring algorithms.", "utterranceID": "20261115-2-c6531"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-2-c6531"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261115-3-3c371"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-3-3c371"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:56:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the data insertion logic to ensure that the fields are cast to the correct types. Additionally, I modified the database schema to enforce stricter type constraints, preventing similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261115-4-2a505"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-4-2a505"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:59:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_c39dc658! This should help improve the accuracy of our lead prioritization.", "utterranceID": "20261115-5-ad831"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-5-ad831"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T07:03:00", "text": "Thanks for the quick turnaround, Ian. Let’s keep an eye on the lead scoring results to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261115-6-8f847"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-6-8f847"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T07:05:00", "text": "Absolutely, Hannah. I'll monitor the results closely and report any anomalies. Thanks, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20261115-7-59f1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-7-59f1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:57:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data import process has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/56.", "utterranceID": "20261117-0-319f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-0-319f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:58:00", "text": "The root cause was a mapping error in our data import script. It was assigning external data fields to the wrong database columns, which led to erroneous data entries and flawed lead qualification.", "utterranceID": "20261117-1-40c40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-1-40c40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:02:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the mapping logic in the script to correctly align the external data fields with the appropriate database columns. I also added some unit tests to ensure this doesn't happen again.", "utterranceID": "20261117-2-c1176"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-2-c1176"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:07:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_652e8cd0! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261117-3-8500a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-3-8500a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! This should really help improve the accuracy of our lead data. I'll run some tests on my end to double-check everything.", "utterranceID": "20261117-4-43cee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-4-43cee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:09:00", "text": "Nice job, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side.", "utterranceID": "20261117-5-a8ab3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-5-a8ab3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:12:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Hannah. @eid_99835861, I'll keep you posted if anything comes up during further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261117-6-b741f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-6-b741f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:02:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for AIX is the limited integration with third-party CRM systems. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0040.", "utterranceID": "20260327-0-cef87"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-0-cef87"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:04:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Ian. It seems like this could be a technical issue, maybe due to incompatibility with various CRM APIs?", "utterranceID": "20260327-1-37308"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-1-37308"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:06:00", "text": "That's possible. The previous team might not have standardized integration protocols, which could be causing these disruptions.", "utterranceID": "20260327-2-0c729"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-2-0c729"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:09:00", "text": "Good point, Ian Brown. Also, could it be that there were limited resources allocated for developing and maintaining these integrations?", "utterranceID": "20260327-3-db0a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-3-db0a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:12:00", "text": "Fiona, I think you're onto something. If the team didn't have enough resources, that could definitely impact the integration quality.", "utterranceID": "20260327-4-0f14b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-4-0f14b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:14:00", "text": "Agreed. Plus, if the architecture isn't modular, it would be tough to support multiple CRM systems efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20260327-5-04e52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-5-04e52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:18:00", "text": "Right. We should consider redesigning the architecture to be more modular in the next release.", "utterranceID": "20260327-6-a545b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-6-a545b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:19:00", "text": "Let's make sure we document these issues and potential solutions in the planning documents for the next AIX release.", "utterranceID": "20260327-7-0a6b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-7-0a6b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, Fiona. I'll start drafting the documentation and share it with you all for feedback.", "utterranceID": "20260327-8-f0765"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-8-f0765"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:09:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about AIX in the latest release!", "utterranceID": "20260426-0-c3704"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-0-c3704"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:13:00", "text": "That's great to hear, Ian! What did they say?", "utterranceID": "20260426-1-2102f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-1-2102f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:14:00", "text": "Customer CUST-0117 mentioned that the platform offers robust customization options, which helps them tailor lead scoring criteria to their specific business needs.", "utterranceID": "20260426-2-0f408"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-2-0f408"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b814ccfb", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:17:00", "text": "Nice! Customization is always a big win for users.", "utterranceID": "20260426-3-67716"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-3-67716"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:22:00", "text": "And CUST-0009 reported that our customer support is responsive and helpful, ensuring issues are resolved quickly.", "utterranceID": "20260426-4-ad3a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-4-ad3a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b85a749", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:26:00", "text": "That's awesome feedback. Kudos to the support team!", "utterranceID": "20260426-5-c3101"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-5-c3101"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:27:08", "text": "@here This blog post explores the role of data analytics in enhancing lead qualification processes. Learn how AIX leverages data for better results. https://analyticsvidhya.com/blog/2023/03/data-analytics-in-lead-qualification/", "utterranceID": "20260403-58-7cb4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260403-58-7cb4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:28:00", "text": "Even though we didn't develop this release, it's great to see the positive impact it's having.", "utterranceID": "20260426-6-75244"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-6-75244"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:32:00", "text": "Absolutely, Hannah. Let's make sure we maintain these strengths moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20260426-7-8a393"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-7-8a393"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:35:00", "text": "Agreed. We should also think about how we can build on these strengths in future updates.", "utterranceID": "20260426-8-9926a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-8-9926a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b814ccfb", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:39:00", "text": "Good idea, Ian. Maybe we can brainstorm some ideas in our next meeting?", "utterranceID": "20260426-9-a0da2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-9-a0da2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:41:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. I'll add it to the agenda.", "utterranceID": "20260426-10-58d15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-10-58d15"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:24:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of AIX. The QA specialist, eid_4de5cd7f, reported that the AI model occasionally misclassifies leads, which could lead to missed opportunities or wasted resources.", "utterranceID": "20260327-0-bc38c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-0-bc38c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. Since the product was developed and QA tested by a different team, we should start by understanding their approach. Could it be due to inadequate training data or biased datasets?", "utterranceID": "20260327-1-edbc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-1-edbc2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:31:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. If the training data wasn't diverse enough, it might not generalize well. We should check the dataset's composition.", "utterranceID": "20260327-2-32c03"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-2-32c03"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:36:00", "text": "Agreed. Also, let's consider overfitting or underfitting. If the model is too complex or too simple, it might not perform well on unseen data.", "utterranceID": "20260327-3-553a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-3-553a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:41:00", "text": "@eid_4f30e22e, that's a valid concern. We should review the model's architecture and training process to ensure it's balanced.", "utterranceID": "20260327-4-64bec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-4-64bec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:43:04", "text": "@here Explore the Scikit-learn library, a powerful tool for building predictive models for lead scoring. Perfect for understanding the tech behind AIX. https://scikit-learn.org/stable/", "utterranceID": "20260330-28-63ec4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-28-63ec4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:44:00", "text": "Another angle is operational. Maybe the model hasn't been updated or retrained regularly to adapt to new data patterns. We should check the update logs.", "utterranceID": "20260327-5-9b980"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-5-9b980"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:47:00", "text": "Yes, keeping the model updated is crucial. Let's make sure there's a process in place for regular updates and retraining.", "utterranceID": "20260327-6-039be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-6-039be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:51:00", "text": "We should document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of AIX. It'll help us track and address them systematically.", "utterranceID": "20260327-7-8ad43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-7-8ad43"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T03:56:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. I'll make sure these points are included in the planning documents. Thanks for the input, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260327-8-871bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-8-871bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T05:04:00", "text": "@eid_55f01e31, @eid_7b85a749, @eid_88e74382, @eid_b814ccfb joined planning-AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260330-32-ddc9d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260330-32-ddc9d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:54:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of AIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_ddbe5577.", "utterranceID": "20260418-0-f333a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-0-f333a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:58:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Charlie Davis. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260418-1-98119"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-1-98119"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:59:00", "text": "The main issue is that the user interface isn't intuitive, making it hard for new users to navigate and use all features effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260418-2-0153e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-2-0153e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:03:00", "text": "Sounds like a UX design problem. Maybe the design didn't consider user feedback enough?", "utterranceID": "20260418-3-06fe0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-3-06fe0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:08:00", "text": "Good point, Ian Jones. It could also be that the design has a steep learning curve. We might need to simplify it.", "utterranceID": "20260418-4-088f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-4-088f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b85a749", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:11:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. Another angle could be the lack of proper user training or onboarding resources.", "utterranceID": "20260418-5-115ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-5-115ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b814ccfb", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:13:00", "text": "True, Charlie Smith. The previous team might not have prioritized training materials.", "utterranceID": "20260418-6-52cbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-6-52cbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:16:00", "text": "We should definitely look into integrating more user feedback in the design process for future releases.", "utterranceID": "20260418-7-fd988"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-7-fd988"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:21:00", "text": "Yes, and maybe we can also create some quick-start guides or tutorials for new users.", "utterranceID": "20260418-8-a9ba8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-8-a9ba8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-03-30T17:25:00", "text": "Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260418-9-e0887"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-9-e0887"}

