{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:20:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data entries in the Lead Database has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/58.", "utterranceID": "20261121-0-12b41"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-0-12b41"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:24:00", "text": "The issue was caused by a race condition in the database transaction handling mechanism. Essentially, multiple transactions were trying to write to the same record simultaneously, leading to data corruption.", "utterranceID": "20261121-1-d618d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-1-d618d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_3f4b2681! How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261121-2-2bc95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-2-2bc95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I added a locking mechanism to ensure that only one transaction can write to a record at a time. This prevents the race condition from occurring.", "utterranceID": "20261121-3-1d929"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-3-1d929"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:31:00", "text": "Nice job, Hannah! Does this fix affect the performance of the database operations?", "utterranceID": "20261121-4-f5493"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-4-f5493"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:34:00", "text": "Good question, Ian Brown. The locking mechanism introduces a slight overhead, but it's negligible compared to the benefit of having accurate data. I've also optimized the lock duration to minimize any potential impact.", "utterranceID": "20261121-5-bed88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-5-bed88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:36:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid solution. Thanks for the update, Hannah!", "utterranceID": "20261121-6-841ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-6-841ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:41:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks for handling this so efficiently, @eid_3f4b2681!", "utterranceID": "20261121-7-7795c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-7-7795c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:45:00", "text": "You're welcome! Let me know if you notice any issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20261121-8-bea44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-8-bea44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:38:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Thread Starvation from Background Tasks' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/59.", "utterranceID": "20261128-0-0302c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-0-0302c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:40:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_3f4b2681! Could you give us a quick rundown of what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261128-1-db36b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-1-db36b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:41:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our background tasks for lead scoring and qualification weren't properly prioritized. They were consuming too many resources, which led to the UI thread being starved and causing unresponsiveness during imports.", "utterranceID": "20261128-2-0e351"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-2-0e351"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:43:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261128-3-6846c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-3-6846c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:47:00", "text": "We implemented a priority queue for the background tasks, ensuring that the UI thread gets the necessary resources to remain responsive. Additionally, we optimized the lead scoring algorithm to reduce its resource consumption.", "utterranceID": "20261128-4-fb469"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-4-fb469"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:49:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Hannah!", "utterranceID": "20261128-5-38d39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-5-38d39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:53:00", "text": "Agreed, great work @eid_3f4b2681. This should make a big difference for our users.", "utterranceID": "20261128-6-342b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-6-342b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:55:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any

