{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd4d2940", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T19:52:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI misinterpretation, integration inconsistencies, UI complexity, performance issues, and lack of customization. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260910-0-a6dab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-0-a6dab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T19:57:00", "text": "@eid_bd4d2940 Julia Davis, I think we should add a section on improving AI training data. The current report doesn't mention the diversity of user behavior, which is crucial for accurate insights. We could also highlight plans for enhancing NLP capabilities. What do you think, @eid_82e9fcef?", "utterranceID": "20260910-1-2688f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-1-2688f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T20:02:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia Taylor. We should also include a feedback loop mechanism for continuous learning. This could be a new subsection under 'Future Developments'. It would show our commitment to improving AI models over time. 📈", "utterranceID": "20260910-2-ac52b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260910-2-ac52b"}
