{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:14:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice. It seems like the complex layout with too many features presented at once could be a major factor.", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-48997"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-48997"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:15:00", "text": "@eid_798684b4, that's a good point. We might need to consider simplifying the interface or providing a customizable dashboard for users.", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-485ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-485ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:18:00", "text": "Another angle could be the navigation. If it's not intuitive, new users might struggle to find what they need.", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-4ba52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-4ba52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_792330e0", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:22:00", "text": "Yes, Emma here. We should also look into the onboarding process. Maybe there aren't enough resources to help users get started.", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-07b72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-07b72"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:26:00", "text": "Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure we document these issues and potential solutions in our planning documents for the next release of extAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-1dbaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-1dbaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:55:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about extAIX. It's great to see such feedback!", "utterranceID": "20260829-0-aaed3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-0-aaed3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:56:00", "text": "That's awesome! What did they say, Ian?", "utterranceID": "20260829-1-9f721"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-1-9f721"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:59:00", "text": "Customer CUST-0016 mentioned that the AI simplifies complex data effectively, making it easier for users to understand and act upon.", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-b1c1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-b1c1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:03:00", "text": "That's a huge win! Simplifying data is always a challenge.", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-c78e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-c78e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:08:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia. And CUST-0055 reported that the system provides real-time insights, which helps users make timely decisions.", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-fad69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-fad69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:11:00", "text": "Real-time insights are crucial. It's great to hear that users are benefiting from it.", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-1c830"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-1c830"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:13:00", "text": "And there's more! CUST-0118 said the integration with Salesforce is seamless, enhancing the platform's overall functionality.", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-71c1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-71c1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:16:00", "text": "Seamless integration is key. Kudos to the previous team for setting such a strong foundation.", "utterranceID": "20260829-7-ba17a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-7-ba17a"}
